				<div class="t-item">
					<span class="stars">★★★★★</span>
					<span><span class="name">Google</span><br /><span class="sub">4.9 rating</span></span>
				</div>
				<div class="t-item">
					<span class="stars">★★★★★</span>
					<span><span class="name">HAR.com</span><br /><span class="sub">4.9 rating · Houston's MLS</span></span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- ============ WHY CHOOSE ============ -->
		<section class="svc">
			<div class="wrap">
				<h2 class="display reveal" style="font-size:clamp(30px,3.8vw,48px)">Why do Northwest Houston sellers and buyers choose the <em>Lippincott Team?</em></h2>
				<p class="lede reveal">Because results here are documented, not claimed. The Houston Business Journal's
					Residential Real Estate Award is not a popularity contest. It ranks teams on verified MLS closed
					volume and transaction counts, and the Lippincott Team has won it nine separate years: 2017 through
					2025, consecutively.</p>
				<p class="lede reveal" style="margin-top:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)">That track record covers every side of your move:</p>
				<div class="svc-grid" style="margin-top:40px">
					<div class="svc-card reveal">
						<div class="n">01</div>
						<h3>Buy</h3>
						<p>Live MLS search across Cypress, Tomball, Katy and Bridgeland with real-time updates
							and a full team behind your offer.</p>
						<a class="link-arrow" href="https://www.thelippincottteam.com/property-search/results/">Search homes →</a>
					</div>
					<div class="svc-card reveal">
						<div class="n">02</div>
						<h3>Sell</h3>
						<p>Professional photography, staging guidance and SEO-optimized exposure, priced from a
							comparative market analysis, not a guess.</p>
						<a class="link-arrow" href="https://www.thelippincottteam.com/sellers/">Sell with us →</a>
