							<h3><span>01</span>Pricing</h3>
							<p>Your list price comes from a comparative market analysis of recent sales in your
								subdivision, not an algorithm and not a guess.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="job">
							<h3><span>02</span>Preparation</h3>
							<p>Staging guidance that performs: one client's staged home sold in a single weekend
								(verified HAR.com client survey).</p>
						</div>
						<div class="job">
