								the buyers already searching your neighborhood.</p>
						</div>
						<div class="job">
							<h3><span>04</span>Negotiation and closing</h3>
							<p>A dedicated listing specialist negotiates your offers; a transaction coordinator manages
								inspection, appraisal and closing timelines. You always know what happens next.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="sec-cta reveal"><a class="link-arrow" href="/contact-us/">Schedule a Consultation →</a></p>
			</div>
		</section>

